#: userland/apps/reliefapk/window.cpp:54
msgid "Search by package name or description. Select one or more packages, choose an operation, then review the pending changes.\n\nPreview runs apk --simulate. Apply executes the changes in the displayed order. Each operation is checked again before execution. System upgrades use the native ReliefOS updater to prepare a verified plan, then apply that exact plan. Review system upgrades separately from other package operations.\n\nRefresh indexes after changing repositories or when available packages are missing. Installed packages remain available offline.\n\nAdministrator operations use your system sudo or root authentication policy. Passwords are never saved.\n\nCtrl+F: search    F5: refresh list    Ctrl+Enter: preview changes"
msgstr "按软件包名称或描述搜索。选择一个或多个软件包及其操作，然后审阅待处理更改。\n\n预览使用 apk --simulate。应用时按显示的顺序执行更改，每项操作执行前会再次检查。系统升级由 ReliefOS 原生更新器准备经过验证的计划，再应用同一份计划。请将系统升级与其他软件包操作分别审阅。\n\n更改软件源或缺少可用软件包时，请刷新索引。离线时仍可查看已安装的软件包。\n\n管理员操作使用系统的 sudo 或 root 认证策略，不会保存密码。\n\nCtrl+F：搜索    F5：刷新列表    Ctrl+Enter：预览更改"

